  "review": {
    "scope": "Only pinned local MiniCheck Python is trusted; all safetensors shards must match official Hugging Face LFS SHA256 even when downloaded via ModelScope.",
    "reviewed_revision": "1ed7786bcda3fa1dc35f7c4ed9e3f36b785d33b8",
    "observations": [
      "InternLM2ForCausalLM architecture; Llama-3.1 in the marketing name refers to the synthetic-data generator.",
      "Reviewed configuration, model and both tokenizer Python modules: neural-network/tokenizer code; no subprocess, eval, exec or outbound HTTP calls found.",
      "Tokenizer file IO is limited to loading/saving its vocabulary; optional flash-attention imports are not installed or enabled.",
      "Use safetensors, local_files_only, eager attention for MiniCheck; never follow the AutoModel mapping to an external repository."
    ],
